{"server":"tw","storyId":"act15mini_level_act15mini_st05","groupId":"act15mini","stageId":null,"title":"歸鄉","storyCode":"","avgTag":"幕間","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act15mini/level_act15mini_st05.txt","sourceHash":"05866d429f97dc543d75d13ac15bbd149ae288bc721b0f03e0b7769e23b3df0a","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"40_g1_blackforest"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩米澤地薩滿","speakerId":"avg_npc_965_1","isRemote":false,"text":"拉格娜，拉格娜。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩米澤地薩滿","speakerId":"avg_npc_965_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你想要我們如何迎接你呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩米澤地薩滿","speakerId":"avg_npc_965_1","isRemote":false,"text":"無論向南還是向北，所有離開的人裡，最不可能回來的就是你。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"遠山","speakerId":"avg_109_fmout_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"遠山","speakerId":"avg_109_fmout_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道，沒有人邀請我回來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"遠山","speakerId":"avg_109_fmout_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只是，我在水晶球中看到了一個預言。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"遠山","speakerId":"avg_109_fmout_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我的兄長遭遇不幸的預言。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"40_g5_samitribe"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唔哦，好漂亮的木雕！這個坐在果殼裡的小人真的會指路嗎？真的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"還有這個，異色的源石晶體！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"要用什麼樣的工藝，才能在雕刻的時候保持晶體穩定呢......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不不不，把一塊源石放在家裡做擺件，是不是太危險了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"上次帶回去的源石冰晶碎片還沒有分析完，但是這個比起研究價值，更重要的是......真的很漂亮！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏薩斯商隊成員","speakerId":"avg_npc_081","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我找找......去烏薩斯時準備的錢幣還剩下幾十切爾文！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"還是說，你們也和薩米本地人一樣，只接受用東西作交換？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那我可以拿一整罐調料來換——但那樣的話，西蒙娜姐和提豐就要陪我一起吃沒什麼味道的薩米食物了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"提豐","speakerId":"avg_2012_typhon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我們本來就是薩米人啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏薩斯商隊成員","speakerId":"avg_npc_081","isRemote":false,"text":"......小姑娘，你想要什麼？沒有東西要換的話，我們就走了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"欸，我是不是太吵了，哈哈......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"抱歉，沒想到還會有烏薩斯商隊到這麼遠的集市來做生意，還帶著這麼多我沒見過的東西！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唔，西蒙娜姐，你之前說我們要交換什麼來著？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......咦，西蒙娜姐？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"提豐","speakerId":"avg_2012_typhon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉。你真的沒聽見？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒、沒啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"提豐","speakerId":"avg_2012_typhon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"剛剛有人認出了她，請她去幫忙了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"提豐","speakerId":"avg_2012_typhon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有幾名死者的遺體被帶回了部族，但是部族沒有雪祀，所以他們拜託西蒙娜幫忙檢查一下遺體。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"欸，有人去世了啊......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"難怪我順著集市一路走過來，沒聽到什麼吆喝聲，也沒什麼人主動接我的話。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"大家看起來都好消沉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唔，就連擺出來的東西也挺少的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那我們等等西蒙娜姐，讓她來做決定吧，是她說一定要來集市交換物資的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可以嗎，來自烏薩斯的朋友？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"40_g5_samitribe"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寒檀","speakerId":"avg_341_sntlla_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......淌過薩米土地的流水啊，請接納我，我將與您的孩子們對話。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寒檀","speakerId":"avg_341_sntlla_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（低聲的哼鳴）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"悲愁的薩滿學徒","speakerId":"avg_npc_965_1","isRemote":false,"text":"起風了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"悲愁的薩滿學徒","speakerId":"avg_npc_965_1","isRemote":false,"text":"從老樹最低的枝椏，到祖母瓦麗門前的火把......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"悲愁的薩滿學徒","speakerId":"avg_npc_965_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......慈悲的命運啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"悲愁的薩滿學徒","speakerId":"avg_npc_965_1","isRemote":false,"text":"既然他們已經同意，請檢查吧，寒檀木之女。他們的遺物都在這裡了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寒檀","speakerId":"avg_341_sntlla_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一介黜人遊歷至此，得受霜槭之根系的信任，我很感激。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寒檀","speakerId":"avg_341_sntlla_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寒檀","speakerId":"avg_341_sntlla_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這些武器上還結著暗紅的冰淩，他們經歷了一場苦戰。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寒檀","speakerId":"avg_341_sntlla_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他們是從北地陣線上被帶回來的戰士嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"悲愁的薩滿學徒","speakerId":"avg_npc_965_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，這幾位戰士七八年前就離開部族去了北方。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"悲愁的薩滿學徒","speakerId":"avg_npc_965_1","isRemote":false,"text":"誰能想到呢，辭別故鄉最久、最不肯回頭的兩位族人，在同一天裡回來了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寒檀","speakerId":"avg_341_sntlla_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您是指死者？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"悲愁的薩滿學徒","speakerId":"avg_npc_965_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......是一對分道揚鑣的兄妹。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"悲愁的薩滿學徒","speakerId":"avg_npc_965_1","isRemote":false,"text":"既然命運讓您在今天來到這裡，或許這個故事也該說給您聽。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"悲愁的薩滿學徒","speakerId":"avg_npc_965_1","isRemote":false,"text":"當年那場覆蓋半個黑森林的異常雪災，您一定記得。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寒檀","speakerId":"avg_341_sntlla_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我記得。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"悲愁的薩滿學徒","speakerId":"avg_npc_965_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那時我們部族也受了影響。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"悲愁的薩滿學徒","speakerId":"avg_npc_965_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就和困在暴風雪中的其他部族一樣，我們祈求薩米的諭示，頂著風雪尋找樹上顯現的密文，想知道如何保全自己。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"悲愁的薩滿學徒","speakerId":"avg_npc_965_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但......我們是一個沒有雪祀的部族。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"悲愁的薩滿學徒","speakerId":"avg_npc_965_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們祈禱啊，祈禱啊，但薩米回應的只有沉默。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"悲愁的薩滿學徒","speakerId":"avg_npc_965_1","isRemote":false,"text":"得不到命運的指引，薩滿們也無法判斷，是留還是走，要去往何處。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"悲愁的薩滿學徒","speakerId":"avg_npc_965_1","isRemote":false,"text":"直到最後，那對兄妹堅定了想法，站出來領頭。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"悲愁的薩滿學徒","speakerId":"avg_npc_965_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是，他們兩個人的想法截然相反。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"悲愁的薩滿學徒","speakerId":"avg_npc_965_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哥哥決定聽從埃克提爾尼爾的口信，帶一部分人前往北地陣線，為剩下的人停下雪災，使他們不必搬遷。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寒檀","speakerId":"avg_341_sntlla_1","isRemote":false,"text":"接受一位非本族雪祀的指引，的確是不得已而為之的方法。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"悲愁的薩滿學徒","speakerId":"avg_npc_965_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但妹妹卻認為，部族已經無法生存，等待雪災停下只會熬死大多數人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"悲愁的薩滿學徒","speakerId":"avg_npc_965_1","isRemote":false,"text":"因此她領著另一部分人，憑著自己的法術一路占卜，避開危險，最終頂著風雪將部族南遷到了這裡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寒檀","speakerId":"avg_341_sntlla_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這一路應該很不容易。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寒檀","speakerId":"avg_341_sntlla_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......對於雙方來說都是如此。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"悲愁的薩滿學徒","speakerId":"avg_npc_965_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"悲愁的薩滿學徒","speakerId":"avg_npc_965_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以我們理解，為什麼那兩個人如此怨恨對方，以至於各自一意孤行，再也沒回過頭。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"悲愁的薩滿學徒","speakerId":"avg_npc_965_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈，我和大姐為了我撞斷她一支獸角裝飾的事，也吵過好幾個月呢。對他們的分歧來說，七八年的時間又算什麼呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"悲愁的薩滿學徒","speakerId":"avg_npc_965_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......唉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"悲愁的薩滿學徒","speakerId":"avg_npc_965_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他手鼓的側面，祝福的文字都這麼模糊了。要是他這幾年回來過一次，我一定會幫他仔仔細細重新雕刻一遍的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寒檀","speakerId":"avg_341_sntlla_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，這面鼓......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寒檀","speakerId":"avg_341_sntlla_1","isRemote":false,"text":"鼓面沒有沾上一點血跡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寒檀","speakerId":"avg_341_sntlla_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但它的主人，那位薩滿巫醫，分明傷得很重。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寒檀","speakerId":"avg_341_sntlla_1","isRemote":false,"text":"恐怕......他受傷時武器根本不在手邊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寒檀","speakerId":"avg_341_sntlla_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寒檀","speakerId":"avg_341_sntlla_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......他的毛皮長襖裡，還留有小半瓶伏特加。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寒檀","speakerId":"avg_341_sntlla_1","isRemote":false,"text":"烏薩斯人用鋼鐵榨出來的苦飲，呵。他們也曾經與烏薩斯人一同坐在火邊，一同喝酒嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寒檀","speakerId":"avg_341_sntlla_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您能否告訴我，是誰帶回了這些戰士的遺體？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"悲愁的薩滿學徒","speakerId":"avg_npc_965_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是一支烏薩斯商隊。怎麼了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寒檀","speakerId":"avg_341_sntlla_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"34_g3_swamp_d"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"“正在確認「黑印」狀態，「列巴羽」即將在水上人家交易。”"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"40_g5_samitribe"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寒檀","speakerId":"avg_341_sntlla_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那支商隊——是否還在這裡？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"悲愁的薩滿學徒","speakerId":"avg_npc_965_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果按照慣例，他們不會在集市停留太久。太陽落山了，前面的路就不好走了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寒檀","speakerId":"avg_341_sntlla_1","isRemote":false,"text":"謝謝，恐怕我必須動身去找他們......打聽一些情況。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"悲愁的薩滿學徒","speakerId":"avg_npc_965_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等一等，寒檀......您還會回來嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寒檀","speakerId":"avg_341_sntlla_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"悲愁的薩滿學徒","speakerId":"avg_npc_965_1","isRemote":false,"text":"作為一個凋敝的部族，我們......想盡可能地請求幫助。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"悲愁的薩滿學徒","speakerId":"avg_npc_965_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這次儀式對我們部族來說，意義重大。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"悲愁的薩滿學徒","speakerId":"avg_npc_965_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不僅是死者的葬禮，也是生者告別家鄉的儀式。多一位博學的薩滿在場，族人們就能多得一份護佑。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寒檀","speakerId":"avg_341_sntlla_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......舉族遷移。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寒檀","speakerId":"avg_341_sntlla_1","isRemote":false,"text":"時隔近百年，薩米的意志再一次諭示如此多的部族向南搬遷嗎......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"悲愁的薩滿學徒","speakerId":"avg_npc_965_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是的。這一次，薩米的意志看向了我們。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"悲愁的薩滿學徒","speakerId":"avg_npc_965_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而且，我們也認得出噩兆。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"悲愁的薩滿學徒","speakerId":"avg_npc_965_1","isRemote":false,"text":"新生的嬰兒整夜哭鬧不停，野獸死在水澤邊......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寒檀","speakerId":"avg_341_sntlla_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（恐懼的預兆。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寒檀","speakerId":"avg_341_sntlla_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（可是，邪魔的污染竟然已經蔓延到了離冰原這麼遙遠的南部澤地？）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寒檀","speakerId":"avg_341_sntlla_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（抑或，烏薩斯人放入薩米的“黑印”其實是——）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寒檀","speakerId":"avg_341_sntlla_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您口中的噩兆，我或許有一些頭緒。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寒檀","speakerId":"avg_341_sntlla_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我答應您，會回來參加儀式。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寒檀","speakerId":"avg_341_sntlla_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但......眼下我另外有些事情要做。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寒檀","speakerId":"avg_341_sntlla_1","isRemote":false,"text":"亡者的靈魂在注視，生者須給予他們安寧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"40_g5_samitribe"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——啊，沒有雪祀這麼糟糕嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這個部族現在過得不好......都是因為沒有雪祀？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"提豐","speakerId":"avg_2012_typhon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（記筆記）“雪祀透過占卜保護著部族。”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“沒有雪祀的部族，有時連接近的天災都無法察覺。”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這麼說，雪祀還要學習天災信使的課程啊......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"提豐","speakerId":"avg_2012_typhon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只靠學習可成不了雪祀。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"提豐","speakerId":"avg_2012_typhon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我在苔原上，遇到過為了成為雪祀，在試煉中奄奄一息的人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"提豐","speakerId":"avg_2012_typhon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唔，我還聽說過，有的部族會等待薩米的感召，成為雪祀的人都會得到一些來自奇跡的指示......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"提豐","speakerId":"avg_2012_typhon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"算啦，這種事你還是問西蒙娜吧。我只是叫你別在集市上到處打聽了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"提豐","speakerId":"avg_2012_typhon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這個部族......就像一隻重病的角獸。你要是總去戳它，叫人家起身，很煩人的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"對不起......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"提豐","speakerId":"avg_2012_typhon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，還有你給我挑的這個結繩手環，一點也不好看，還礙事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"欸嘿。我只是找個理由讓你陪我一起逛集市嘛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"提豐","speakerId":"avg_2012_typhon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你已經差不多是個完整的薩米人了，在南邊這種有鐵疙瘩的地方，已經可以自己出去玩了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我就是覺得，有你陪著比較好！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不知道為什麼，我有種不好的預感。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"提豐","speakerId":"avg_2012_typhon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......一般來說，你的預感會很靈驗嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不會欸。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"其實我一般什麼預感都沒有。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"提豐","speakerId":"avg_2012_typhon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"說說看。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"提豐","speakerId":"avg_2012_typhon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你感覺到的東西，是像一頭裂獸的影子，還是一段巨木的裂痕？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，都不像......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等等，裂獸？欸，這裡還會有裂獸嗎？如果真的遇到了，能不能拜託你來處理？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"提豐","speakerId":"avg_2012_typhon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，上路之前我會把自我保護的方法再給你講一遍的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"提豐","speakerId":"avg_2012_typhon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我問的是，你的預感本身是什麼樣子？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唔......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"對我來說，就是因為想不明白它具體是什麼，所以才叫它預感吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我只是感覺，好像有什麼東西已經離得很近了，可我卻沒注意到它。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"對，就像抹掉這層雪，底下就是超級大發現，我卻直接從上面走過去了一樣！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嘿嘿，雖然瑪麗老師總是說我確實會犯這種錯誤啦......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊——啊嚏！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"欸，雪突然大了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——啊，西蒙娜姐，你終於回來了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寒檀","speakerId":"avg_341_sntlla_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們，見過一支烏薩斯商隊嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"見過呀，他們還送了我一個空酒壺，說什麼“陛下在上”“邊防軍不會喜歡，帶不回去”之類的。你看。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我本來想等你回來，看看要不要跟他們交換一些東西，但是他們說時間不等人，就急匆匆地走了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寒檀","speakerId":"avg_341_sntlla_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......你放他們離開了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"提豐","speakerId":"avg_2012_typhon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他們剛剛往那個方向走了。你找他們有事的話，現在應該還追得上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"提豐","speakerId":"avg_2012_typhon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"西蒙娜，你在生氣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"提豐","speakerId":"avg_2012_typhon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"發生什麼事了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寒檀","speakerId":"avg_341_sntlla_1","isRemote":false,"text":"抱歉......只是，既然他們送了禮物，那我也應該懂得禮尚往來，僅此而已。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寒檀","speakerId":"avg_341_sntlla_1","isRemote":false,"text":"麥哲倫，提豐，你們跟著部族繼續往察帕特走，路上一定要注意安全，可以嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寒檀","speakerId":"avg_341_sntlla_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一旦有任何異常發生，不要想著應對，儘快逃離，生存優先。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"提豐","speakerId":"avg_2012_typhon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你也一樣，西蒙娜。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寒檀","speakerId":"avg_341_sntlla_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呵呵，不用擔心我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寒檀","speakerId":"avg_341_sntlla_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我會很快回來，追上你們......我答應過他們，我會參加那些戰士的葬禮。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"提豐","speakerId":"avg_2012_typhon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......麥麥，你在想什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"奇怪。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我剛剛好像是在想，應該讓西蒙娜姐幫忙看看，這酒壺上的薩米文字到底是什麼意思。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是不知道怎麼就走神了，問題也忘了問。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"算啦，先把酒壺收起來好了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"40_g1_blackforest"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"溫和的薩滿","speakerId":"avg_npc_965_1","isRemote":false,"text":"拉格娜，他們回來了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"溫和的薩滿","speakerId":"avg_npc_965_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你的占卜還是那麼準。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"溫和的薩滿","speakerId":"avg_npc_965_1","isRemote":false,"text":"蒂拉今天真的空手而歸了，要知道，她現在可是我們部族最好的獵手。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"溫和的薩滿","speakerId":"avg_npc_965_1","isRemote":false,"text":"還有，你看這手鐲，我弄丟好幾年了。我的小兒子找到了它，就像你說的，“幸運之事，自深水之中”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"溫和的薩滿","speakerId":"avg_npc_965_1","isRemote":false,"text":"以及......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"溫和的薩滿","speakerId":"avg_npc_965_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那漆黑的死亡，也確實降臨在了我們的戰士身上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"遠山","speakerId":"avg_109_fmout_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"溫和的薩滿","speakerId":"avg_npc_965_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以，我不得不問你，當年為什麼要那麼做？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"溫和的薩滿","speakerId":"avg_npc_965_1","isRemote":false,"text":"為什麼明知占卜將我們引向北方，你卻要與之背道而馳？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"遠山","speakerId":"avg_109_fmout_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......抱歉，我只是回來見我的親人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"遠山","speakerId":"avg_109_fmout_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果對葬禮沒有別的安排......我就先離開了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"溫和的薩滿","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"拉格娜......！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嚴厲的薩滿","speakerId":"avg_npc_965_1","isRemote":false,"text":"隨她去吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嚴厲的薩滿","speakerId":"avg_npc_965_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她與薩米的土地已經沒有聯繫，我們沒必要苛責這麼一個可憐人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"遠山","speakerId":"avg_109_fmout_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"欸，遠山姐，怎麼樣？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他們還是不太喜歡你？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"遠山","speakerId":"avg_109_fmout_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我已經預想到了會是這樣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唔......至少能在旅途中碰到朋友，說明今天運氣很好！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我看到你的時候，還以為自己又出現幻覺了呢，真的好巧！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——呃，抱歉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我聽說這裡有人過世了，該不會......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"遠山","speakerId":"avg_109_fmout_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒關係，我是占卜到了我兄長的死才回來的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"遠山","speakerId":"avg_109_fmout_1","isRemote":false,"text":"原本我們也......因為一些事情，產生了巨大的分歧，很長時間沒有互通音訊了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"提豐","speakerId":"avg_2012_typhon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可是，儀式裡職責最重要的薩滿，卻並沒有在準備葬禮啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"遠山","speakerId":"avg_109_fmout_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......麥哲倫，你有個很敏銳的朋友呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"提豐","speakerId":"avg_2012_typhon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這不是什麼秘密。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"提豐","speakerId":"avg_2012_typhon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而且，如果只是普通地與死者告別，人們是不會這麼難過的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"提豐","speakerId":"avg_2012_typhon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果還有機會與死者告別，你也不至於這麼難過。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"遠山","speakerId":"avg_109_fmout_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......是啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"遠山","speakerId":"avg_109_fmout_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我原本以為，七年過去，樹會抽出新枝，大家也能在這片土地上牢牢扎根，過上安逸的日子......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"遠山","speakerId":"avg_109_fmout_1","isRemote":false,"text":"結果我看到的，卻是我的族人被越來越頻繁的災害折磨，甚至不得不再次搬遷。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"遠山","speakerId":"avg_109_fmout_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而薩滿們竟會為是否要舉辦傳統的葬禮而爭執不下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"提豐","speakerId":"avg_2012_typhon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唔......但是，要是一句話不說，那怎麼能叫告別呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"遠山","speakerId":"avg_109_fmout_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"提豐","speakerId":"avg_2012_typhon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所有東西本來就會像羽獸一樣飛走，再也見不到。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"提豐","speakerId":"avg_2012_typhon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這種時候就算你出聲嚇到它們，也沒關係的。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"40_g1_blackforest"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"溫和的薩滿","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我......從沒答應過不舉行葬禮。請您不要再提出這個建議了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"溫和的薩滿","speakerId":"avg_npc_965_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他們足夠幸運，回到了家鄉的土地，我們怎麼能把他們長久地留在寒夜裡，困在自己的肉體旁不得解脫？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嚴厲的薩滿","speakerId":"avg_npc_965_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這片土地很快就不再是我們的家鄉了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"溫和的薩滿","speakerId":"avg_npc_965_1","isRemote":false,"text":"正因如此，他們才需要沉船歸鄉的儀式，才需要順著水流找到故人......！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嚴厲的薩滿","speakerId":"avg_npc_965_1","isRemote":false,"text":"災難就在眼前。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"溫和的薩滿","speakerId":"avg_npc_965_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嚴厲的薩滿","speakerId":"avg_npc_965_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——他們就是災難的一部分。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嚴厲的薩滿","speakerId":"avg_npc_965_1","isRemote":false,"text":"岩角獸沒日沒夜地發狂奔逃，直至力竭而死，這是預兆。在北地陣線上，此刻我們會吹起號角，徹夜警戒等待。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嚴厲的薩滿","speakerId":"avg_npc_965_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他們都是戰士。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嚴厲的薩滿","speakerId":"avg_npc_965_1","isRemote":false,"text":"戰士從無善終。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"溫和的薩滿","speakerId":"avg_npc_965_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"溫和的薩滿","speakerId":"avg_npc_965_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那只是個傳言，不是嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"溫和的薩滿","speakerId":"avg_npc_965_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您的命運，並沒有在前往北方冰原作戰之後變得一片漆黑，相反，您還獲得了薩米的諭示與祝福。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"溫和的薩滿","speakerId":"avg_npc_965_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可您卻出於戒心，想讓他們為自己的軀殼站崗放哨，直到屍身朽爛......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"溫和的薩滿","speakerId":"avg_npc_965_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那裡躺著的也有您最心愛的學生啊，他此刻也正在聽您冰冷的言語。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嚴厲的薩滿","speakerId":"avg_npc_965_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那就讓他聽吧，他是最堅毅的戰士，他會心甘情願領受這一切。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"遠山","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"——您說得對。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"遠山","speakerId":"avg_109_fmout_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們......為何不問問死者本人有什麼看法？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嚴厲的薩滿","speakerId":"avg_npc_965_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......看來那兩個外來人給了你某種盲目的勇氣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嚴厲的薩滿","speakerId":"avg_npc_965_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是，你應該知道雪祀已經離開很久了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嚴厲的薩滿","speakerId":"avg_npc_965_1","isRemote":false,"text":"祖母瓦麗過世後，部族再沒有人受到過感召。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嚴厲的薩滿","speakerId":"avg_npc_965_1","isRemote":false,"text":"還是說，你也主張改變傳統，不再等待感召，而是效仿那些主動為雪祀設立試煉的部族？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"遠山","speakerId":"avg_109_fmout_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"遠山","speakerId":"avg_109_fmout_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我......可以嘗試占卜他們的意願。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"溫和的薩滿","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"拉格娜......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"遠山","speakerId":"avg_109_fmout_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......是，我在請求命運擺佈我們。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"遠山","speakerId":"avg_109_fmout_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您不必質問，就直接稱我為出爾反爾之人吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嚴厲的薩滿","speakerId":"avg_npc_965_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那麼，我不會阻攔你的嘗試。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"溫和的薩滿","speakerId":"avg_npc_965_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......好吧，只要族樹願意抬起樹枝，讓你行船進入，那麼我也不會阻攔。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"溫和的薩滿","speakerId":"avg_npc_965_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們等待死者的回答。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"40_g1_blackforest"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"提豐","speakerId":"avg_2012_typhon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你不用趕著去察帕特嗎？我看你們南方人總是匆匆忙忙的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"提豐","speakerId":"avg_2012_typhon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"比如，說是過來旅遊，但是你們的......唔，運輸工具，他們直直地開過來，一群人在空地上站一會，運具又直直地開走了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，我當然很擔心瑪麗老師。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可是，現在我要做的事情，就是盡可能收集薩米的資訊，方便搜救隊開闢路線呀。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而且，我也想陪一陪遠山姐嘛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在羅德島，大家都說，遠山姐情緒波動最大的時候，也就只有打牌輸掉的時候而已。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我都沒想過她會有現在這樣難過的表情......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你呢，提豐，那個在察帕特等著你的委託人很著急嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"提豐","speakerId":"avg_2012_typhon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不知道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"欸？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"提豐","speakerId":"avg_2012_typhon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯。其實我都不知道，等在南方城市的那個委託人到底是誰，又要我過去做什麼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"提豐","speakerId":"avg_2012_typhon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"大概又是有人想悄悄地託我處理麻煩吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"提豐","speakerId":"avg_2012_typhon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"下次帶你去看看好了，有時候那些傢伙搞得神神秘秘的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"提豐","speakerId":"avg_2012_typhon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"結果我從樹洞裡拿出來的木板，上面寫的只是有一隻死掉的角獸需要人搬走。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"提豐","speakerId":"avg_2012_typhon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"影子已經不在死去的角獸身邊了，不過，大部分人找不到它之後，心裡更害怕，只好找我幫他們處理了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唔，這麼說，大家很信任你呀。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"難道他們不願意直接接近你，真的是覺得你的弓會帶來厄運？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那、那是不是就像......礦石病一樣？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"提豐","speakerId":"avg_2012_typhon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"礦石病？不，不一樣，怎麼會一樣呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"提豐","speakerId":"avg_2012_typhon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"西蒙娜得了礦石病，難道就不值得尊敬了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"提豐","speakerId":"avg_2012_typhon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但我......我也不確定自己是不是真的馴服了這把弓。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......可是弓在你的手上，如果它不好用了，那感覺應該會跟我的無人機運轉不靈差不多？總會有什麼感覺的吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"提豐","speakerId":"avg_2012_typhon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我醒的時候當然可以死死地盯住它。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"提豐","speakerId":"avg_2012_typhon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可是我做夢的時候，意識從我的身體離開的時候呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"提豐","speakerId":"avg_2012_typhon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們南方人聽過這樣的說法嗎？“談論厄運的人越多，厄運的陰影就越清晰。”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"提豐","speakerId":"avg_2012_typhon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒聽過？好吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"提豐","speakerId":"avg_2012_typhon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"以前我一直待在艾爾啟的洞窟裡，那個時候，沒有人認識我和我的武器。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"提豐","speakerId":"avg_2012_typhon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但現在可不一樣。我有這種本領，我要到處幫忙，把影子從薩米趕出去。與之相對應地......談論我的人也越來越多。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"提豐","speakerId":"avg_2012_typhon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我也不知道厄運會不會突然發現我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唔，我相信你的弓是不會出問題的......！因為我跟你一起走了這麼久也沒遇到問題嘛！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但這也的確不是嚴謹的證明方法......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"對啦，要是能把你的武器帶給我的工程科同事們分析一下就好啦，說不定能給出一些解釋，我聽得懂的那種。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而且他們還能幫你想想辦法。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"比如說，梅爾還蠻擅長應對危險物品的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嘿嘿，而且她和我關係超級好，肯定不會責怪我攜帶有潛在風險的武器衝進她的實驗室......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......不過我們從北地帶回去的樣本，每個都要研究好久好久，我可不能把你的武器拿走好幾年。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（咦......？）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"提豐","speakerId":"avg_2012_typhon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"謝謝你，你真努力。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"提豐","speakerId":"avg_2012_typhon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但我說過，不要碰我的武器。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"提豐","speakerId":"avg_2012_typhon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這是只有我自己能處理的事情，艾爾啟也是這麼說的......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"提豐","speakerId":"avg_2012_typhon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......麥哲倫，你在做什麼？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"欸？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"提豐","speakerId":"avg_2012_typhon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"放手。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"麥哲倫下意識地鬆開手。隨著“撲通”一聲，她猛地回過神來，睜大眼睛盯著水潭上蕩開的漣漪。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我......剛剛丟了什麼進去？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"提豐","speakerId":"avg_2012_typhon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那個烏薩斯人送你的酒壺。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"提豐","speakerId":"avg_2012_typhon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你剛剛在用它接沼澤裡的泥水。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"提豐","speakerId":"avg_2012_typhon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唔，我教過你可以用衣服吸水濾掉泥沙，但是......你應該不是忘記了。你看起來不對勁。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"欸......啊！真的欸，我剛剛又走神了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我得把別人送我的禮物撈起來......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"提豐","speakerId":"avg_2012_typhon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你不敢伸手，是嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"提豐","speakerId":"avg_2012_typhon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"把手給我。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"欸，這種情況你也有應對方法？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......呼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好像真的冷靜下來了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在手指上纏一根藤條居然這麼有用，你真厲害！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，你給自己也纏了一根。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"提豐","speakerId":"avg_2012_typhon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"提豐","speakerId":"avg_2012_typhon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不過，你還是別去撈了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"提豐","speakerId":"avg_2012_typhon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"西蒙娜不是說了嗎？注意安全。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好吧......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"提豐","speakerId":"avg_2012_typhon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......真奇怪，剛剛那個明明是我面對邪魔的時候才會有用的方法......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"提豐","speakerId":"avg_2012_typhon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"難道西蒙娜的提醒......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"40_g1_blackforest"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"遠山","speakerId":"avg_109_fmout_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......死者回答了我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"遠山","speakerId":"avg_109_fmout_1","isRemote":false,"text":"多數人想要下葬。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"遠山","speakerId":"avg_109_fmout_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只有一人......保持了沉默。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嚴厲的薩滿","speakerId":"avg_npc_965_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"溫和的薩滿","speakerId":"avg_npc_965_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沉默意味著至少不反對，是不是？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"溫和的薩滿","speakerId":"avg_npc_965_1","isRemote":false,"text":"死者意願如此，我們必須尊重。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嚴厲的薩滿","speakerId":"avg_npc_965_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......既然如此，那就照常舉行葬禮吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_coldforest"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"遠山","speakerId":"avg_109_fmout_1","isRemote":false,"text":"上船時小心，麥哲倫。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，謝謝！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"遠山","speakerId":"avg_109_fmout_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這就是我們澤地部族的習俗。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"遠山","speakerId":"avg_109_fmout_1","isRemote":false,"text":"入夜之後行船，流水推動木舟，到了船葬處，死者隨船沉入水底。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"遠山","speakerId":"avg_109_fmout_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只有這樣，死者才能從軀殼的束縛中解脫，自在地行走林間，順著流水尋找自己血脈相連的族親。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"遠山","speakerId":"avg_109_fmout_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只不過，這次葬禮，也是我們與故鄉告別的儀式。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"遠山","speakerId":"avg_109_fmout_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以大家會帶上家當，踏上船隻，和死者一起走。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"遠山","speakerId":"avg_109_fmout_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......死者沉船歸鄉，生者離開家鄉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那我和提豐不是你們的親人，也不是部族成員，也可以跟著你們的船隊一起走嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"遠山","speakerId":"avg_109_fmout_1","isRemote":false,"text":"當然。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"遠山","speakerId":"avg_109_fmout_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不如說，要謝謝你們願意和我同行。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"遠山","speakerId":"avg_109_fmout_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我早已知道自己是孤身一人，在薩米之外的土地上流浪......但送行自己最後的親人，要獨乘一艘小船的時候，還是會覺得太過苦澀。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"遠山","speakerId":"avg_109_fmout_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......至少，葬禮能夠舉行，我的族人應該會感到慰藉吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"遠山","speakerId":"avg_109_fmout_1","isRemote":false,"text":"無論生者，還是死者。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"遠山","speakerId":"avg_109_fmout_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哎呀，你向我伸手，是需要我也扶你一把嗎，提豐？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"提豐","speakerId":"avg_2012_typhon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"提豐","speakerId":"avg_2012_typhon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只是你的手摸起來很冰涼，遠山。就像有很冷很冷的風一直吹著你，你只能不停地眨眼，將手緊緊攥在一起。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"遠山","speakerId":"avg_109_fmout_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"提豐","speakerId":"avg_2012_typhon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我一直都想問你一個問題。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"提豐","speakerId":"avg_2012_typhon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在你的占卜中，死者究竟回答了什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"提豐","speakerId":"avg_2012_typhon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"或者說，你占卜到的“沉默”，究竟是怎麼回事？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"遠山","speakerId":"avg_109_fmout_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"40_i05"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩米澤地居民","speakerId":"avg_109_fmout_1","isRemote":false,"text":"號角聲響了，別再回頭張望了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩米澤地居民","speakerId":"avg_109_fmout_1","isRemote":false,"text":"既然命運叫我們前行，那麼遺落在這裡的，總會歸還於我們。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩米澤地居民","speakerId":"avg_109_fmout_1","isRemote":false,"text":"撐船吧。"},{"type":"narration","text":"人們不再言語，船隊最前方，傳來薩滿低沉的歌聲。\n死者將追隨先靈而去，他們的名字被一一報出。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"風吹響了載著遺體的小舟上的一串銅鈴。\n儀式已經開始，船隊就不會再回頭。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"遠山","speakerId":"avg_109_fmout_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我很抱歉。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"第四次占卜，我所見的景象依舊是“儀式”。\n那麼，第五次占卜，我向......拉瑟，發問。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"40_g1_blackforest"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"遠山","speakerId":"avg_109_fmout_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"遠山","speakerId":"avg_109_fmout_1","isRemote":false,"text":"拉瑟，我有話對你說。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"遠山","speakerId":"avg_109_fmout_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......不，或許是想聽你對我說。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"遠山","speakerId":"avg_109_fmout_1","isRemote":false,"text":"從那場暴風雪中走出來的路很長，河始終沒有解凍。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"遠山","speakerId":"avg_109_fmout_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我在薩米之外的地方生活，隨著鋼鐵的船隻漫遊。那艘船太穩，難免讓人夢見當時族人們拖著船在冰上走的情狀。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"遠山","speakerId":"avg_109_fmout_1","isRemote":false,"text":"走到後來，很多人都沒有餘力再拖著船，有的人連自己的身體也拖不動了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"遠山","speakerId":"avg_109_fmout_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......那條路上有太多的犧牲，因此我不敢再回頭。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"遠山","speakerId":"avg_109_fmout_1","isRemote":false,"text":"事實就是這樣。我只是不敢回頭了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"遠山","speakerId":"avg_109_fmout_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們的確做了截然相反的決定，的確曾為此拔出武器指向對方，但我並不是因為記恨你而不肯歸鄉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"遠山","speakerId":"avg_109_fmout_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......不過，對於駐守北地的戰士而言，如此事實，或許也無關緊要。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"遠山","speakerId":"avg_109_fmout_1","isRemote":false,"text":"儀式甕中的樹葉已經快燃盡了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"遠山","speakerId":"avg_109_fmout_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以，請你......回答我。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"遠山","speakerId":"avg_109_fmout_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你為什麼——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"遠山","speakerId":"avg_109_fmout_1","isRemote":false,"text":"兄長啊，你為什麼還是不願意回應我？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"遠山","speakerId":"avg_109_fmout_1","isRemote":false,"text":"黑暗，霧氣，黑暗。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"遠山","speakerId":"avg_109_fmout_1","isRemote":false,"text":"空空的水晶球。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"遠山","speakerId":"avg_109_fmout_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我怎麼會，什麼都看不見？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[]}
